{
  "_readme": [
    "Hand-labelled expected output for the LLM-0 gate (docs/local-llm.md §7).",
    "",
    "real-sample.txt is the one real document, copied from docs/samples/ so the",
    "harness does not depend on a folder that is gitignored. The other three are",
    "SYNTHETIC — written to stress the cases a five-entry excerpt cannot answer:",
    "entries carrying no type phrase, type vocabulary drifting across a year, and",
    "the sensitive content a school clinician actually writes. Any accuracy number",
    "computed from this corpus is provisional until 1-2 complete redacted documents",
    "arrive (docs/local-llm.md §9, 'the remaining ask').",
    "",
    "`category` is what a person would file the entry under. Where an entry is",
    "genuinely ambiguous the label is the more specific reading, because that is",
    "the one a wrong answer actually costs something."
  ],

